  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If we are to be subject to parts of our model being limited, it would be useful to be able to see how others see your model depending on what they have switched off. Especially regarding shaders if you want to make sure they are falling back gracefully, currently the only way to do it is to find a friend and get them to take a photo of you with the specific avatar aspects blocked, it is slow and cumbersome. A \"Me\" option or similar would be an excellent tool for making sure your avatar works for all people and degrades gracefully.",
